"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: ここでは、飛空艇探索に参加される冒険者に向け、<br>「ディアデム諸島」への揚陸艇に搭乗するための、<br>「青燐水引換券:雲海探索」を販売しています！
#. de: Bei mir kannst du Erdseim ordern, Abenteurer<if $gn4>in</if>! Damit steht deiner Expedition zum Diadem auf einem gut gewarteten und stabilen Luftschiff der Haillenartes nichts mehr im Wege.
#. fr: Si vous voulez des bons de transport pour partir en expédition sur les îles du Diadème, je suis la personne qu'il vous faut<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_JAQUOINIE_000_000:1"
msgid "Will you be registering for the next mission? If so, you will need to submit proof of purchase for a tank of ceruleum."
msgstr "Записываетесь на следующее задание? Тогда понадобится предъявить подтверждение покупки бака с церулумом."

#. ja: ……ですが、かの地は危険な暗礁空域。<br>相応の実力がなければ、無事ではすまないでしょう。<br>改めてお越しください。
#. de: Aber an deiner Stelle würde ich mir das noch mal gut überlegen. Du siehst mir ziemlich jung aus. Wirf dein Leben nicht weg, du hast bestimmt noch viel vor auf dieser Welt.
#. fr: Hmm... Si ça ne tenait qu'à moi, je prendrais vos gils avec plaisir, mais messire Aurvael m'a interdit de vendre mes coupons aux aventuriers qui n'ont pas assez d'expérience. Repassez me voir quand vous aurez pris un peu plus de bouteille, d'accord<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_JAQUOINIE_000_010:1"
msgid "...Ah, a thousand pardons, <if $gn4>miss<else>sir</if>. Due to the dangers our parties often face on these expeditions, we can accept only the most experienced individuals."
msgstr "...Прошу прощения, <if $gn4>госпожа<else>господин</if>. На такие вылазки часто отправляют в смертельно опасные места, поэтому мы можем принять лишь самых опытных."

#. ja: 「雲海探索 ディアデム諸島」を開始するためには、<br>以下の条件を満たす必要があります。
#. de: Um die Expedition zum Diadem zu beginnen, müssen folgende Voraus<shy>setzungen erfüllt sein:
#. fr: Il est nécessaire de remplir les deux conditions suivantes pour participer aux missions d'exploration sur les îles du Diadème.
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_SYSTEM_000_011:1"
msgid "In order to embark upon an Ishgardian exploratory mission, you and your party must meet the following requirements:"
msgstr "Чтобы отправиться на исследовательское задание из Ишгарда, вы и ваша группа должны выполнить следующие требования:"

#. ja: 1.「メインクエスト：蒼天のイシュガルド」において、<br>　クエスト「蒼天のイシュガルド」をコンプリートしている。
#. de: 1. Du hast den Heavensward-Hauptszenario-Auftrag „Himmelwärts“ abgeschlossen.
#. fr: 1. Avoir au moins une classe de combat ou de magie de niveau 60.
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_SYSTEM_000_012:1"
msgid "※You must have completed the main scenario quest “Heavensward.”"
msgstr "※ Вы должны завершить задание основного сюжета «Heavensward»."

#. ja: 2.ファイター、もしくはソーサラーのレベルが60以上である。
#. de: 2. Du bist in einer Krieger- oder Magierklasse auf Stufe 60.
#. fr: 2. Avoir accompli la quête de l'épopée (Heavensward) “Les yeux rivés au ciel”.
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_SYSTEM_000_013:1"
msgid "You must be a level 60 Disciple of War or Magic."
msgstr "Вы должны быть бойцом или магом не ниже 60-го уровня."

#. ja: なお、クエストの進行具合は、<br>メインコマンドの「ジャーナル」から確認できます。
#. de: Der Fortschritt dieser Aufgabe kann im Archiv eingesehen werden.
#. fr: Pour vérifier si vous avez terminé cette quête, veuillez consulter le Journal, dans le Menu principal.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_SYSTEM_000_014:1"
msgid "To review your quest progression, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Duty</ui-edge-color></ui-color> from the main menu, followed by <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Journal</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Чтобы проверить прохождение задания, выберите в главном меню <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Активности»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, а затем <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Журнал»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: ……ですが、かの地は危険な暗礁空域。<br>飛空艇探索についての知識を得てからのほうが良いでしょう。<br>まずは「オールヴァエル」様より、お話を伺ってくださいませ。
#. de: Aber an deiner Stelle würde ich mir das noch mal gut überlegen. Du scheinst mir nicht recht viel über das Diadem zu wissen. Sprich doch erst mal mit Aurvael und lass dir erklären, was wir hier überhaupt machen.
#. fr: Hmm... Si ça ne tenait qu'à moi, je prendrais vos gils sans hésiter, mais je crois que vous feriez mieux de parler à messire Aurvael d'abord. Il s'agit d'une zone ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment dangereuse et je préfère que vous sachiez où vous mettez les pieds avant de dépenser votre argent.
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_JAQUOINIE_000_020:1"
msgid "Wait─have you spoken with Lord Aurvael yet? I thought not. It would be best if you did so first."
msgstr "Постойте... Вы уже говорили с лордом Орваэлем? Вот и славно. Сначала лучше поговорить с ним."

#. ja: どうする？ [所持 青燐水引換券:雲海探索：<num $n1>枚]
#. de: Was möchtest du tun?<br>(Erdseim-Orderscheine in Besitz: <num $n1>)
#. fr: Que voulez-vous faire<nbsp>? [<kilo $n1 "<nbsp>"> bon<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if> possédé<if ($n1 <= 1)><else>s</if>]
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "Что желаете сделать?"

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を<num $n2>枚購入する（<kilo $n3 ",">ギル）
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1></capitalize> kaufen (<kilo $n3 "."> Gil)
#. fr: Acheter <num $n2> bon<if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if> de transport pour <kilo $n3 "<nbsp>"> gils
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = number parameter 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n3 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 3, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_A1_000_001:1"
msgid "Purchase <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> for <kilo $n3 \",\"> gil."
msgstr "Купить <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>один<case>два<case>три<case>четыре<case>пять<case>шесть<case>семь<case>восемь<case>девять<case>десять</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> <noun-en Item 3 $n1 $n2 1> за <kilo $n3 \",\"> гил."

#. ja: やめる
#. de: Nichts
#. fr: Annuler
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_A1_000_002:1"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr "Ничего."

#. ja: 「<sheet Item $n1 0>」を<num $n2>枚、<br><kilo $n3 ",">ギルで購入します。<br>本当によろしいですか？
#. de: <capitalize><noun-de Item 1 $n1 $n2 4 1></capitalize> für <kilo $n3 "."> Gil kaufen?
#. fr: Acheter <num $n2> bon<if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if> de transport pour <kilo $n3 "<nbsp>"> gils<nbsp>?
#. macro: <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 2 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <kilo $n3 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 3, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_Q2_000_000:1"
msgid "Purchase <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> of the following for <kilo $n3 \",\"> gil?"
msgstr "Купить <if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>один<case>два<case>три<case>четыре<case>пять<case>шесть<case>семь<case>восемь<case>девять<case>десять</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if> штуки за <kilo $n3 \",\"> гил?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_A2_000_001:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/003/RegRoc2SkyIslandShop_00312:TEXT_REGROC2SKYISLANDSHOP_00312_A2_000_002:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"
